.png","name":"Henry N.","verified_text":"Verified Buyer","rating":5,"review_text":"I scrubbed at a set-in carpet stain for months; this spray actually broke it down after a couple treatments and the space smelled clean again. Took patience but worth it for a rental cleanup."}},"review_yq9iwp":{"type":"review","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ChatGPT_Image_May_8_2026_03_13_06_AM.png","name":"Adam F.","verified_text":"Verified Buyer","rating":4,"review_text":"Sprayed on an ancient mattress pet stain and left it to sit; after blotting, the discoloration was noticeably reduced and the odor neutralized, great for busy pet owners."}},"review_uloo18":{"type":"review","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2026-05-08_at_3.13.37_am.png","name":"Kevin W.","verified_text":"Verified Buyer","rating":5,"review_text":"Treated an old stain on my carpet and it faded a lot; odor control was the best part, really noticeable improvement."}},"review_DzDPAj":{"type":"review","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2026-05-08_at_3.15.02_am.png","name":"John D.","verified_text":"Verified Buyer","rating":5,"review_text":"I’d been dealing with a stubborn carpet stain for ages and nothing seemed to work. After using this spray a few times, it finally started breaking down and the area smelled fresh again."}},"review_49mc8n":{"type":"review","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/ChatGPT_Image_May_8_2026_03_17_12_AM.png","name":"Noah V.","verified_text":"Verified Buyer","rating":4,"review_text":"Tried on an old rug with embedded stains; required two treatments but the results were worth it, carpet looks much better and less musty now."}},"review_5rrczn":{"type":"review","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2026-05-08_at_3.19.13_am.png","name":"Paul G.","verified_text":"Verified Buyer","rating":4,"review_text":"Tested on a microfiber couch with an old stain: repeated application removed most of the mark, no fabric damage